{"id":"61dd587baa22cc0f","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-finite-string-dimension-complexity.md","title":"有限串维数的复杂度刻画与最优选择稳定性","display":"thm-finite-string-dimension-complexity — 有限串维数的复杂度刻画与最优选择稳定性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-finite-string-dimension-complexity","aliases":["43-thm-finite-string-dimension-complexity"],"display":"thm-finite-string-dimension-complexity — 有限串维数的复杂度刻画与最优选择稳定性","depends_on":["[[43-df-termgale]]","[[43-df-finite-string-dimension]]","[[43-df-prefixkolm]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Theorems 17.11.6,17.11.8,17.11.10–17.11.11","source_printed_pages":"547–549","source_pdf_pages":"567–569","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_statement_checked":false,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-finite-string-dimension-complexity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-finite-string-dimension-complexity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-finite-string-dimension-complexity — 有限串维数的复杂度刻画与最优选择稳定性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c6501493b1a4f2e7\" href=\"?note=c6501493b1a4f2e7\" title=\"43-df-termgale\">43-df-termgale</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f32ef993d95e406c\" href=\"?note=f32ef993d95e406c\" title=\"43-df-finite-string-dimension\">43-df-finite-string-dimension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorems 17.11.6,17.11.8,17.11.10–17.11.11"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"547–549"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"567–569"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OptimalTermgale}\">\\(\\operatorname{OptimalTermgale}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c6501493b1a4f2e7\" href=\"?note=c6501493b1a4f2e7\" title=\"43-df-termgale\">43-df-termgale</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dim_D^\\ell\">\\(\\dim_D^\\ell\\)</span>、固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^*\">\\(D^*\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dim_{\\square}\">\\(\\dim_{\\square}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f32ef993d95e406c\" href=\"?note=f32ef993d95e406c\" title=\"43-df-finite-string-dimension\">43-df-finite-string-dimension</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a>。所量化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,E\">\\(D,E\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,\\infty)\">\\([0,\\infty)\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,\\infty)^{\\mathcal T}\">\\([0,\\infty)^{\\mathcal T}\\)</span> 的族。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists D\\in\\bigl(\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}^{\\mathcal T}\\bigr)^{\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}}\\;\\operatorname{OptimalTermgale}(D).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists D\\in\\bigl(\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}^{\\mathcal T}\\bigr)^{\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}}\\;\\operatorname{OptimalTermgale}(D).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall D,E\\in\\left\\{F\\in\\bigl(\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}^{\\mathcal T}\\bigr)^{\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}}:\\operatorname{OptimalTermgale}(F)\\right\\}\\;\\forall\\ell_1,\\ell_2\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists r,t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;\\left[r=\\dim_D^{\\ell_1}(\\sigma)\\land t=\\dim_E^{\\ell_2}(\\sigma)\\land|r-t|\\le\\frac c{1+|\\sigma|}\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall D,E\\in\\left\\{F\\in\\bigl(\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}^{\\mathcal T}\\bigr)^{\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}}:\\operatorname{OptimalTermgale}(F)\\right\\}\\;\\forall\\ell_1,\\ell_2\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists r,t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;\\left[r=\\dim_D^{\\ell_1}(\\sigma)\\land t=\\dim_E^{\\ell_2}(\\sigma)\\land|r-t|\\le\\frac c{1+|\\sigma|}\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists b\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\dim_{\\square}(\\sigma)\\le b.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists b\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\dim_{\\square}(\\sigma)\\le b.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;\\left(r=\\dim_{\\square}(\\sigma)\\land\\left|K(\\sigma)-|\\sigma|r\\right|\\le c\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;\\left(r=\\dim_{\\square}(\\sigma)\\land\\left|K(\\sigma)-|\\sigma|r\\right|\\le c\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>最优离散半测度在终止串上给出最优终止鞅。其精确比例首先是 (|σ|+1) 乘维数；统一有限上界允许把 +1 的影响吸收到常数，得到书中最终 |σ| 公式。绝对值稳定性来自分别交换两族使用 Theorem 17.11.8。空串在最终复杂度公式中无除零。</p>\n<p>来源：所供 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorems 17.11.6,17.11.8,17.11.10–17.11.11，印刷页 547–549，PDF 页 567–569。来源定位沿用附件；此次修订核查形式化与内部一致性，未重新核对原书PDF。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-termgale","status":"resolved","id":"c6501493b1a4f2e7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-termgale]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-finite-string-dimension","status":"resolved","id":"f32ef993d95e406c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-finite-string-dimension]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-termgale","status":"resolved","id":"c6501493b1a4f2e7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal T$、$\\operatorname{OptimalTermgale}$ 见 [[43-df-termgale]]；$\\dim_D^\\ell$、固定 $D^*$ 的 $\\dim_{\\square}$ 见 [[43-df-finite-string-dimension]]；$K$ 见 [[43-df-prefixkolm]]。所量化 $D,E$ 为 $[0,\\infty)$ 到 $[0,\\infty)^{\\mathcal T}$ 的族。","embed":false},{"ta